    "primaryResearch": {
      "synthesisConfidence": 82,
      "evidenceUnits": 412,
      "synthesis": "High-frequency episodic and chronic migraine patients are increasingly steered toward oral CGRPs at first preventive failure. IV reframing outperforms efficacy-led messaging by 2.4x in HCP recall when paired with onset-of-action evidence from PROMISE-1.",
