        {
          "tier": "T1 KOL",
          "name": "Dr. R.B.",
          "org": "Headache Center, Northeast AMC",
          "quotes": 5,
          "quote": "My switch trigger is really about giving patients something that feels different. The IV ritual itself - four times a year, done - that is a story patients tell themselves.",
