            "ritual and differentiation",
            "patient adherence"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tier": "T1 KOL",
          "name": "Dr. M.S.",
          "org": "Midwest Headache Clinic",
          "quotes": 3,
          "quote": "Where I see Vyepti winning is the 2-4 prior failures crowd. By then the patient has lost faith. Showing them a Day 1 effect is a clinical reset.",
